		 <!-- //tab -->
		<section class="cont-sec appli-schd">
			<div class="inner">
				<div class="text-wrap">
					<h2>2027학년도 수시 신입생 모집 재외국민 특별전형 모집요강(2027년 3월 입학)</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="table-wrap">
					<table>
						<colgroup>
							<col class="col_1" />
							<col class="col_2" />
							<col class="col_3" />
						</colgroup>
						<thead>
							<tr>
								<th>구분</th>
								<th>일시</th>
								<th>비고</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody>
						<tr>
								<td><strong>원서접수</strong></td>
								<td>
									2026-07-06(월)&nbsp;&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;&nbsp;~&nbsp;&nbsp;
									2026-07-10(금)&nbsp;&nbsp;15:00까지</td>
								<td>인터넷 접수만 실시 / 접수처 : 유웨이어플라이</td>
